+#
+# `pattern` is here for the same measured reason. Measured 2026-11-26:
+# `list_files(glob="*.py")` -- `glob` is the word the model reaches for --
+# carried a field the schema does not name, was silently passed over, and
+# listed the WHOLE workspace, while `pattern="*.py"` lists two files. A
+# synonym cannot be reached by similarity at all (`_suggestion("glob",
